    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa muntu, tangisha mpata webe ku Yelushalema, ela dî diebe ku miaba ya tshijila, bela buloba bua Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ambila buloba bua Isalele ne, Yehowa udi wamba ne, Ndi nkuhidia, nempatule muele wanyi wa nvita mu tshimanga tshiau, nembutule bantu ba munkatshi muenu, bakane ne babi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua ndi mbutula bantu bakane ne bantu babi ba munkatshi muebe, nunku muele wanyi wa nvita neuhatuke mu tshimanga tshiau bua kutaha bantu bonso ba ku luseke lua sude tô ne ku luseke lua node. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bonso nebamanye ne, Meme Yehowa nakuhatula muele wanyi wa nvita mu tshimanga tshiau; kawena uhinganamu kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, muana wa muntu, humuna muoyo, humuna muoyo ne kanyinganyinga kakole ne mutshima wa majia ku mesu kuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakukonkabo ne, Bualu kai udi uhumuna muoyo? Wewe ubakudimune dî ne, Bualu bua lumu ludi lulua; ne halunvuabo, mitshima ya bantu bonso neyihandike, maboko onso neikale matekete, mioyo ya bantu bonso neyihange, binu bionso nebitekete-teketê bu mai. Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Tangila, bualu ebu hudi bulua, nebuenjibue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi kabidi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa muntu, ambila bantu mei a buprofete buebe, ubambile ne, Yehowa udi wamba ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, wewe, muana wa muntu, amba mei ebe, tuta tshikashi, muele wa nvita utahe tshiakabidi, utahe tshiakasatu, muele wa nvita wa bantu bashihibue, muele wa nvita mene wa bantu bashihibue udi ubalamina ku nseke yonso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakubabishila muele wa nvita bua kubakuatshisha buowa, tô ne hahandika mitshima yabo, bua bantu ba bungi badishinde hehi ne bibi biabo bionso. Muele wa nvita udi uhenya bu muele wa nvula, udi musekeshibue bua kushiha nʼau bantu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshunguluka, wewe, muele wa nvita, ku luseke lua tshianza tshia balume, ne ku luseke lua tshianza tshia bakashi, kuonso kudi mpata webe utangila! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meme kabidi nentute bikashi, nendekele tshiji tshianyi; meme Yehowa nakuamba mei anyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi kabidi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe kabidi, muana wa muntu, usungule nshila ibidi idi muele wa nvita wa mukelenge wa Babulona mua kuyilamu, bubidi buai mihatuke mu buloba bumue; teka tshimanyinu mu nshila, utshiteke ku disanga dia nshila udi mutangile ku musoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sungula biebe nshila bua muele wa nvita uyilemu bua kufika ku Laba, musoko wa Bena Amona, ne nshila wa ku Yelushalema, musoko wa mu Yuda, udi munyunguluke ne ngumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua mukelenge wa Babulona udi wimana ku masangu a nshila, kundekelu kua nshila ei ibidi, bua kutempesha lubuku; udi unyungisha mikete, udi webesha telafima, udi utangila mu mutshima wa nyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bintu bia kutempa nʼabi bia mu tshianza tshiandi tshia balume biakamulesha bua Yelushalema bantu kushikamamu, mua kuela mbila ya nvita, mua kujadika mitshi minene ku mpala kua bibi bua kubishimbula, mua kuela mishiki ya buloba ne kuasa bibumba bia kutshintshimika nʼabi musoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mesu kua ba mu Yelushalema kutempa eku kua mbuku nekuikale bu kutempa kudi kubadinga, bualu bua badi bela meji ne, Tshikondo netshilehe tô ne ku mbingu ya bungi; kadi Yehowa udi uvuluka bubi buabo, bua bobo bakuatshibue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Bualu bua nuakunvuluisha bua mibi yenu, bua malu mabi enu akusokolodibua, ne mibi yenu idi imueneka mu bienzedi bienu bionso; bualu bua badi banuvuluka ku malu â nebunukuate ku bukole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne wewe, muntu mubi udi mutaha ne mputa wa lufu, mukokeshi wa Bena Isalele, muena dituku dia dikenga didi ha buihi, mu tshikondo tshia dikenga dia kunshikidilu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Yehowa udi ukuambila ne, Umusha tshitambala, utule tshifulu tshiebe tshia bunfumu; malu onso neandamuke! Bandisha bahuekele, huekesha babandile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nembutule, nembutule, nembubutule kabutu; kabuena buikalaku kabidi tô ne halua udi muakanangane nʼabu, ne nemuhebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe kabidi, muana wa muntu, amba mei a buprofete buebe, ubambile ne, Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba bualu bua Bena Amona, bua bihendu bidibo bahenda nʼabi Bena Isalele, ne, Muele wa nvita, muele wa nvita, udi muhatula bua kushiha nʼau bantu, udi munonoke bua kuhenya bu muele wa nvula; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu bua bakukulesha bikena kumona bidi bikudinga, bakukutempela mbuku ya mashimi, bakukuelela mukenji bua wewe kuteka muele eu ha nshingu ya bantu babi badi batahibue mputa ya lufu, bena dituku diakumana kufika mu tshikondo tshia dikenga dia kunshikidilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhingashe mu tshimama tshiau! Bualu bua mu muaba wakakufukabo, mu buloba buwakaledibua, nenkulumbuluishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
